{"candidate_identity":"f0957fd75e21509fb26166c0b8e7e43a480e2c5089819c042e2ace6ead817c63","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c2d2a69123046cc6e0c38535beea8a05474caa82f3a39dd47bfd0f0eed725925","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76310fdc4e9d0c7c180b366d7ba953bb9280eda22d2c7bdb1072d35b5dafab51","logical_entry_identity":"5539aa15eac9de553dec50b7f94dff6e77bde7975b1e8c96d2aba8331c4f4647","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hunter","source_tag":"_t","target":"猎手"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"628421a8a1daad720f376041c50973f2bbaf5a71b49ee805eee24e0fc1c7e11e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7631f448deb0857f3a0237204c85e2d0f1aed40d7436c066ca5873faae3f76f7","logical_entry_identity":"01372cffa739f4c487b5a2de1b929817b044d49933a17166ae620ad9ad2353ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Both Norgan and you made it home.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你和诺尔甘都回到了家。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d603e64ccd2d678dfceeb24fec849e4411e9c7719a90e7805e29dac937959e61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"763210f7d461a407ee5e4e441d0209f9a3353dcb706365b129ea9c7ca5c918dc","logical_entry_identity":"6f3a332777d4f758819cc864e254a1fc20f18e6c95f132b359c844bd5fd5caa3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Slasul bound his lifeforce to yours and gave your a powerful trident in return.","source_tag":"_t","target":"萨拉苏尔将自己的生命力与你的生命力绑定，并以一把强大的三叉戟作为回报。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5213cbf0de133fc0acffe29fb0e5186e3357e8665dabb2725932ba22a12f4685","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7635a456ed8ae580ab0abfd2215036d85946faf8d05866b8e3f39b775d8df34a","logical_entry_identity":"ef1155f8f05aedf3b1db69349b90d31d5bcb711187b658a2ce5ca519bac9113f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#This is a page from what you assume is Kyless' journal.#{normal}#\n\nI've come so far in the last year. The other merchants listen to me now. They think I have a real gift for trade.\nThe weak-minded peasants we trade with are so easy to control though. They practically give me their money.\nBut the real money and power rests with the bandits. Those two that ambushed me got what they deserved. So did the rest of their camp.\nThe fear on their faces when I struck was priceless. They must have had more gold than the caravan makes in a year!\nI got some help carrying it off to a nearby cave. A few more encounters like that and I'll be rich.\nUntil then, I'll stay with the caravan. The only prolem is Jak. He doesn't trust me.\nI guess I threaten his authority. Not sure what I'll have to do about that...\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#你感觉这应该是克里斯日记中的一页。#{normal}#\n\n在过去一年内我进步神速。现在其他商人都愿意听从我了。他们认为我真的有商业天赋。\n那些跟我们做买卖的农民意志薄弱，实在太容易控制了。他们简直是在把钱白送给我。\n但是真正的钱财与力量却掌握在那些强盗手里。上次那两个偷袭我的人已经得到了他们应有的惩罚。他们营地里的其他人也一样。\n我攻击他们时，他们脸上惊恐的表情令我感到无比快意。他们的黄金想必比商队一年赚的还多！\n我叫了些帮手帮我把战利品抬到附近的洞穴里。再有几次这样的遭遇，我就能发财了！\n在那之前，我还会和商队呆在一起。眼下只有一个问题，那就是贾克。他并不信任我。\n我猜是因为我对他的权威构成了威胁。我还不知道该怎么处理这件事……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c6b4a06e51119ac65d09235048b1f895b42cd9102c7f871152b0d16beef37b1e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7636949524027fa786cdb89db0c7d372892fff09462debbf54da9abdb89b2802","logical_entry_identity":"4da3eda9abe04907c2e9075c9edab90cf563a70523feecf5cca9f7f7fa5ef6e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Corrupted Negation","source_tag":"talent name","target":"能量腐蚀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d090ba6425899435ba90eb1f0e9f80a33885b8c47d0098d2514171e78f8dbd12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"763db442e7b21ba44ba94ec1728607e5f4de2e7e5d6b8fb42a3c4e922a7d9c1b","logical_entry_identity":"a04968190422d476ae1fd346b368d13e6ad90d8287fbe0ab3b24f143fb3f8911","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attack diagonally right and down","source_tag":"_t","target":"攻击右下方目标"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"521aa61b228a24868810ab08cfa613c2c6b113ce145267782bf77457255c2414","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76436d9f39d9c75e